reer talent &amp; Passion in Technology age</h3><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4 line-clamp-2\">Created digital content, managed social media posts, and supported event coverage.</p><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f flex gap-2 flex-wrap mb-4\"><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Media</span><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Design</span><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Photography</span></div></div><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f min-w-[320px] lg:min-w-[360px] snap-start\"><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f aspect-[4/3] bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800 mb-5 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"bring.jpg\" alt=\"Bring me hope\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition duration-700\"/></div><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2\">PUC<!-- --> · <!-- -->2023</p><h3 class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-2xl font-light mb-3 text-black dark:text-white\">Bring me hope</h3><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4 line-clamp-2\">logistical and helped set up technical equipment for events.</p><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f flex gap-2 flex-wrap mb-4\"><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Organization</span><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Technical Support</span></div></div><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f min-w-[320px] lg:min-w-[360px] snap-start\"><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f aspect-[4/3] bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800 mb-5 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"CTF.jpg\" alt=\"Capture The Flag Volunteer\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition duration-700\"/></div><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2\">AUPP<!-- --> · <!-- -->2023</p><h3 class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-2xl font-light mb-3 text-black dark:text-white\">Capture The Flag Volunteer</h3><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4 line-clamp-2\">Assisted in organizing cybersecurity competitions and workshops.</p><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f flex gap-2 flex-wrap mb-4\"><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Cybersecurity</span><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Event Management</span></div></div><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f min-w-[320px] lg:min-w-[360px] snap-start\"><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f aspect-[4/3] bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800 mb-5 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"phnom.jpg\" alt=\"Mountain Festival Volunteer\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition duration-700\"/></div><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2\">ទFestival<!-- --> · <!-- -->2024</p><h3 class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-2xl font-light mb-3 text-black dark:text-white\">Mountain Festival Volunteer</h3><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4 line-clamp-2\">Assisted in organizing and managing festival activities.</p><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f flex gap-2 flex-wrap mb-4\"><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Event Management</span><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Coordination</span></div></div><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f min-w-[320px] lg:min-w-[360px] snap-start\"><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f aspect-[4/3] bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800 mb-5 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"intern.jpg\" alt=\"Spring Internship\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition duration-700\"/></div><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2\">Spring Education<!-- --> · <!-- -->2024</p><h3 class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-2xl font-light mb-3 text-black dark:text-white\">Spring Internship</h3><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4 line-clamp-2\">Assisted in creating educational content and supporting online classes.</p><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f flex gap-2 flex-wrap mb-4\"><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Education</span><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Content Creation</span><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Top 2 member</span></div></div><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f min-w-[320px] lg:min-w-[360px] snap-start\"><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f aspect-[4/3] bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800 mb-5 overflow-hidden\"><img src=\"AYO.jpg\" alt=\"local youth ambassador\" draggable=\"false\" class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f w-full h-full object-cover hover:scale-105 transition duration-700\"/></div><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs uppercase text-gray-400 mb-2\">ASEAN Youth Organization<!-- --> · <!-- -->2024</p><h3 class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-2xl font-light mb-3 text-black dark:text-white\">local youth ambassador</h3><p class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4 line-clamp-2\">Promoted youth engagement and community service initiatives.</p><div class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f flex gap-2 flex-wrap mb-4\"><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Youth Leadership</span><span class=\"jsx-20110d6d0ff15f9f text-xs border px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400\">Community Se